OL,3,ANato welcomes Greenland deal as Trump
OL,4,Asays it will give US 'permanent
OL,5,Asecurity control'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US and Denmark have announced a
OL,8,Fdeal on Greenland's security, resolving
OL,9,Fa diplomatic dispute sparked by
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump's threats to
OL,11,Fseize it by force.
OL,13,FNato said the deal would help stabilise
OL,14,Fthe region, as Trump said Denmark would
OL,15,Fgrant the US "permanent control over
OL,16,Fsecurity, and all other needs" in the
OL,17,Fsemi-autonomous Danish territory in the
OL,18,FArctic.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
