OL,3,AOur head teacher was an abuser. We
OL,4,Ajoined forces to get justice - now
OL,5,Awe're married
OL,6,
OL,7,FAhmad Imanuddin Sumar, known to his
OL,8,Fstudents as "Abah" ["father"], had a
OL,9,Freputation to uphold. He was the widely
OL,10,Frespected leader of an Islamic boarding
OL,11,Fschool on the Indonesian island of
OL,12,FLombok. And Abah had discovered that
OL,13,FYusron and his old school friends had
OL,14,Fbeen collating testimony from several
OL,15,Fstudents who say he sexually assaulted
OL,16,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
