OL,3,AJournalists denied White House access
OL,4,Aafter Trump banned some media outlets
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitico, CNN and MS NOW journalists
OL,7,Fhave been denied access to the White
OL,8,FHouse after US President Donald Trump
OL,9,Fannounced he was banning the outlets.
OL,11,FAn MS NOW reporter and a photographer
OL,12,Ftried entering the White House grounds
OL,13,Fon Saturday morning, but their badges
OL,14,Fwould not scan and an officer
OL,15,Fconfiscated them, the outlet reported.
OL,17,FBoth CNN and Politico also said
OL,18,FSaturday morning that their reporters
OL,19,Fwere denied access and had their badges
OL,20,Fseized.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
